{"asset_key":"ep4/env_story_14303111","episode":"ep4","category":"env_story","story_id":"14303111","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1430311101:1":{"text":"うまく言えないけど……当時、私は病気で意識が朦朧としてたの。","source_cn":"这很难形容……当时的我已经病到意识模糊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6DEC922CAD0DECCD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1430311102:1":{"text":"そんな中で、何かを飲んだような気がして……気づいたら、すっかり治っていたのよ。","source_cn":"恍惚间我好像喝了什么……之后醒来时，我就已经恢复。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5947516CEB4A8A09","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1430311103:1":{"text":"その時は、司祭様が女王陛下に祈りを捧げていたんだ。","source_cn":"而那位祭司正站在我身边，正在向女王祷告。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B3C194E0181A351","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:贵族法芙":{"text":"貴族のファフ","source":"贵族法芙","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:贵族恩特":{"text":"貴族のエント","source":"贵族恩特","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":2}}